(5, "The LEGO Movie", 100, 5, 5, 3, 8, "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lbctonEnewCYZ4FYoTZhs8cidAl.jpg", "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1490017/", 2014, "An ordinary LEGO construction worker, thought to be the prophesied as special, is recruited to join a quest to stop an evil tyrant from gluing the LEGO universe into eternal stasis.", 3);
